  fairlady). FEATURES-V5 LANE GOVERNED MANIFEST.

  Drop into .repo/local_manifests/ as 1vivy-features-v5.xml after:

      repo init -u https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android.git -b 16.0
      # base manifest pinned at a311bc97e4784ee24e8f97e377d06bdbff85b4bb

  then `repo sync`.

  USE THIS FILE INSTEAD OF 1vivy-rom.xml, 1vivy-features-v2.xml AND
  1vivy-features-v4.xml - NEVER ALONGSIDE ANY OF THEM. They all declare the same
  paths, so placing two in local_manifests/ at once is a configuration error.

  THIS MANIFEST IS PUBLISHED-HEAD, exactly as v4 and v2 were. DO NOT run
  patches/patch/apply-patches.py against a tree synced from this file: the
  profile is already contained in these heads by construction and replaying it
  would DOUBLE-APPLY. 1vivy-rom.xml is the opposite lane.

  WHY V5 EXISTS. v4 RECONCILED previously authored commits; it did not re-author
  the code. Owner ruling 2026-08-11: the feature sets are completed this
  generation, and a row that merely "ships" is not done. v5 therefore carries
  re-authored work on top of the exact v4 heads, not a new reconciliation.
  Design is `.omo/plans/features-v5/` (124 of 124 matrix rows specified).

  Composed 2026-08-11, derived MECHANICALLY from 1vivy-features-v4.xml by
  swapping the eight 1vivy topic revisions from staging/features-v4/all to
  staging/features-v5/all. Nothing else was changed, and the camera-port pins
  below were RE-MEASURED against the real remote this session rather than
  inherited from v4's prose:

      android_frameworks_av              bade1ca9f81d7b819e27d39497349531359c3b9f   (unchanged on 16.0)
      android_frameworks_native          7e6caf56f2a6550e89e03286cbc9f3401629b2c3   (unchanged on 16.0)
      android_device_qcom_sepolicy_vndr  838178d538901e80223d2e638df45d7295ffeb48   (unchanged on 16.0)
      android_packages_apps_Sandbox      83d599f08df598770926afcccfd860f979418678   (unchanged on 16.0)

  The eight topic-bearing repositories ride staging/features-v5/all, branched
  from the published v4 heads (topic verify recorded ahead=0 dirty=no on every
  one of them before the first v5 commit landed).

  Only lineage_infiniti-bp4a-userdebug is built and runtime-validated. macan,
  macanc and fairlady are present for source closure and static lunch
  resolution; no runtime result is implied for them.
-->
